---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | KSTDC Citizen Travel"
  description="Data handling and privacy standards for the KSTDC citizen travel discovery and booking prototype."
>
  <div class="py-10 sm:py-16 bg-canvas min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      
      <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-4 space-y-1">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-forest uppercase tracking-wider block">
          Data Protection & Privacy
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink font-serif-heading">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">
          Last updated: August 2026 · Karnataka State Tourism Development Corporation
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-hairline shadow-card space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink font-serif-heading">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            To facilitate tour package discovery, personalized trip planning, and digital boarding pass issuance, we collect essential booking information including lead passenger name, email address, contact phone number, and selected pickup points.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink font-serif-heading">2. Local Device Storage</h2>
          <p>
            In this prototype implementation, booking records and user preferences (such as language, high-contrast mode, and low-bandwidth toggles) are stored locally in your browser's <code>localStorage</code>. No personal data is transmitted to unauthorized external advertising networks.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink font-serif-heading">3. Security & Payments</h2>
          <p>
            All payment interfaces featured in this prototype are simulated sandbox flows designed to illustrate the zero-friction 3-step checkout experience without requesting real financial credentials.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink font-serif-heading">4. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
          <p>
            For assistance with tourism bookings or questions regarding KSTDC services, citizens may reach the 24x7 Karnataka Tourism Helpline at <strong>1800-425-3333</strong> or visit the KSTDC Head Office on Kasturba Road, Bengaluru.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
